From 18ae5e94e5c4f753d0715f2182ae84b9b14b5a7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jichao Zhu <jichzhu@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 16:12:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] net: stmmac: dwmac-qcom-ethqos: switch to SCMI PHY driver

Signed-off-by: Jichao Zhu <jichzhu@qti.qualcomm.com>

Replace inline SCMI perf domain management with the dedicated
phy-qcom-sgmii-eth-scmi PHY driver. Delegate SerDes power and
performance state control to the PHY layer.
---
